1
00:00:00,886 --> 00:00:03,136
(Leonard:)Yes! First place.

2
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:08,020
(Leonard:)I would have been a great jockey
if I weren't too tall.

3
00:00:08,728 --> 00:00:11,188
(Leonard:)And scared of horses.

4
00:00:11,355 --> 00:00:12,395
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you're up.

5
00:00:13,274 --> 00:00:14,774
(Sheldon:)- What?
- Come on, it's your turn.

6
00:00:14,942 --> 00:00:17,072
(Leonard:)We said we'd get more fresh air.

7
00:00:18,571 --> 00:00:22,451
(Sheldon:)Sorry. I'm a little distracted.
I can't seem to get in touch with Amy.

8
00:00:22,658 --> 00:00:25,408
(Sheldon:)I tried e-mail, video chat,
tweeting her...

9
00:00:25,578 --> 00:00:28,578
(Sheldon:)...posting on her Facebook Wall,
texting her, nothing.

10
00:00:28,748 --> 00:00:31,418
(Leonard:)Did you try calling her
on the telephone?

11
00:00:31,917 --> 00:00:33,247
(Leonard:)The telephone.

12
00:00:36,589 --> 00:00:39,469
(Sheldon:)You know, Leonard,
in your own simple way...

13
00:00:39,675 --> 00:00:42,095
(Sheldon:)...you may be the wisest of us all.

14
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:44,430
Voicemail.

15
00:00:44,597 --> 00:00:48,267
Tsk. Curiouser and curiouser.

16
00:00:48,434 --> 00:00:51,104
(Leonard:)If you're worried,
we can go and see if she's all right.

17
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:53,810
(Penny:)Okay.
You know, I heard in the news...

18
00:00:53,981 --> 00:00:58,021
(Sheldon:)...a bobcat has been spotted
in her neighborhood.

